{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The exploration reached the intended overlap. With no transfer, joint exit completed. With one `TimeoutNow` dropped, the transfer aborted at tick 10, but the leader remained in joint configuration through tick 40 with no Ready work pending. A later normal proposal triggered exit.\n\nThat finite observation does not prove indefinite stalling. I’ll strengthen the check by testing whether the complete protocol state repeats under the same live tick-and-delivery schedule.\n"}}
